  "label": "liturgical vestments",
  "description": "The clergy in the image are wearing specific religious garments (chasuble, alb, stole) that are part of Catholic liturgical tradition. Recognizing these as liturgical vestments requires background knowledge of Catholic church attire and its symbolic meaning in religious ceremonies. The contrast between these sacred garments and the mundane context of waiting for cookies is central to the meme’s humor.",
